+and healthy playing audio retain their 250 ms coherence bounds. Capture also
+requires the current uninterrupted playback window and the original main's
+inclusive start/exclusive end. Pause, source replacement and real audio barriers
+retire that window. Live tilt/classifier freshness and producers without packet
+receipt provenance retain their existing short admission bounds.
+
