+the final experimental boundary: finalization closes producer admission and
+drains records already accepted. A packet still buffered on the sensor may
+arrive after that cutoff and cannot be recovered by the admission fix. Complete
+terminal-tail coverage needs a separately qualified stream/packet cutoff or
+drain acknowledgment; a one-second receipt-gap check alone cannot establish it.
